        <mxCell id="v20" value="Business rules:&lt;br&gt;• available_copies ≤ total_copies&lt;br&gt;• A book with an open Loan cannot be deleted&lt;br&gt;• Loan is overdue when due_date has passed and return_date is null&lt;br&gt;• Member account can only access its linked Member data" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fillColor=#FFF9E6;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5A4A00;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="470" y="850" width="650" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
